Requirements:
- Git bash installed
- Docker installed
- Uvicorn installed



## Starting the code
-- open docker
-- open folder using git bash

# 1. Start Supabase
supabase start

# 2. Start FastAPI backend
- open the credify_main folder in windows powershell
- run py -m uvicorn main:app --reload
uvicorn main:app --reload

# 3. Open frontend
- open index.html in a browser (or use Live Server in VS Code)


# opening the database
go to browser and paste in address bar: http://localhost:54323/
congrats!
# properly stopping the code
- run command "supabase stop" in git bash
- close docker application

